{"version":1,"content":"<p>青衣青富苑青隆閣B座LG1層昨晚（13日）食水泵爆裂，大量食水湧入升降機槽，導致8部升降機暫停使用，居民難以出入。</p><p>工程人員今早（14日）到場搶修，於12時18分重開其中一部高層升降機，截至今日下午5時，一部中層升降機及一部低層升降機亦已重開。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.454618+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T11:19:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T09:37:42.028349+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416321+00:00","content_hash":"c722edc0e31d4c3b96f72359e20a8ecec3d6a69a0512b297bdb19f14bdad8d1e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}